## 4. Virtual Environment Setup

### Windows PowerShell

```powershell
cd C:\Users\user\Desktop\Translaton-benchmark
python -m venv .venv
.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
```

### Windows Command Prompt

```cmd
cd C:\Users\user\Desktop\Translaton-benchmark
python -m venv .venv
.venv\Scripts\activate.bat
```

### Linux / macOS

```bash
cd ~/path/to/Translaton-benchmark
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
```

